  "description": "Young, bumbling, and romantic, Daniel da Silva Rosa possesses a special gift: the ability to identify superheroes and supervillains on sight, even when they’re not in disguise! That’s how he stumbles into working as a low-level support agent at the International Federation of Super Heroes. But when Daniel’s love interest, the kind and sweet Wyatt, is exposed as a villain and arrested for murder and vigilante terrorism, Daniel must sleuth behind the scenes to suss out his beloved’s innocence. \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Includes three side story chapters.*",
